WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:10.590
Campaigns: campaigns with a goal, deadline, story and progress; each campaign's public page and an appeal to past donors.

2
00:00:11.139 --> 00:00:18.450
Click "New campaign": the three-language title, "Goal", "Deadline" and the story in each language.

3
00:00:18.997 --> 00:00:25.990
In "Other names (comma separated)", write the names people use so the assistant recognises the campaign.

4
00:00:26.541 --> 00:00:30.170
Put the "Campaign page link" in stories and your bio.

5
00:00:30.715 --> 00:00:38.490
Use "Appeal to donors" to message past donors; anyone who didn't opt in or said stop is left out automatically.

6
00:00:39.043 --> 00:00:43.160
A campaign that has gifts isn't deleted but closed.
